!Name: rake-c5o-p360
!C It's easy to build c/5 puffers by bouncing gliders between
!C c/5 spaceships. Often, you can reduce the period by
!C circulating multiple gliders.
!C Here's a demonstration of such a puffer, cleaned
!C up by David Bell to form a p360 rake.
